50
00:02:20,007 --> 00:02:21,742
IT'S SO IMPORTANT TO STILL BE
ABLE TO INTERACT WITH THE OTHER

51
00:02:21,742 --> 00:02:25,379
GIRLS, BECAUSE IT'S EASY
