78
00:03:37,050 --> 00:03:39,052
I HAVE NEVER
DONE ACTING BEFORE.

79
00:03:39,052 --> 00:03:41,354
THE ONLY ACTING I DO
IS MY OWN PERSONALITY.

80
00:03:41,354 --> 00:03:42,522
LIKE, I LIVE IN MY OWN WORLD.

81
00:03:42,522 --> 00:03:43,690
I'M MY OWN ACTRESS.

82
00:03:43,690 --> 00:03:45,559
Sande: SO ONE HAND
ON THE HEART,

83
00:03:45,559 --> 00:03:48,662
ONE ON THE SOLAR PLEXUS,
AND ALLOW YOUR CREATIVE SELF

84
00:03:48,662 --> 00:03:50,397
TO COME FOREGROUND.

85
00:03:50,397 --> 00:03:54,401
