628
00:26:37,196 --> 00:26:40,365
Norelle: I AM SO NERVOUS,
AND ANY LITTLE THING

629
00:26:40,365 --> 00:26:42,601
WILL SEND YOU HOME, ANYTHING.

630
00:26:42,601 --> 00:26:45,170
Nicole: I CAN'T EVEN BEGIN
TO IMAGINE WHO'S GONNA GO HOME.

631
00:26:45,170 --> 00:26:47,039
SOME WEEKS THEY MIGHT BANK MORE
ON PERSONALITY,

632
00:26:47,039 --> 00:26:48,707
SOME WEEKS THEY MIGHT BANK MORE
ON THE PHOTO SHOOT.

633
00:26:53,178 --> 00:26:55,247
Tyra: KONBANWA.

634
00:26:55,247 --> 00:26:56,515
YOU'RE LIKE,
"WHAT THE HECK IS SHE SAYING?"

635
00:26:58,617 --> 00:27:03,055
WELCOME TO YOUR FIRST JUDGING
IN JAPAN.

636
00:27:03,055 --> 00:27:05,591
IF YOU NOTICE,
WE ALL HAVE OUR SHOES OFF,

637
00:27:05,591 --> 00:27:07,459
INCLUDING MYSELF.

638
00:27:07,459 --> 00:27:09,228
Janice: OH!

639
00:27:09,228 --> 00:27:11,163
Tyra: REMOVING YOUR SHOES
WHEN YOU ARE ENTERING

640
00:27:11,163 --> 00:27:14,333
SOMEONE'S HOME IN JAPAN
IS A SIGN OF RESPECT.

641
00:27:14,333 --> 00:27:16,335
NOW IT'S TIME
TO MAKE OUR NINTH CUT,

642
00:27:16,335 --> 00:27:18,237
WHICH WILL BRING US
ONE STEP CLOSER

643
00:27:18,237 --> 00:27:21,607
IN DETERMINING WHO WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

644
00:27:21,607 --> 00:27:25,144
OF COURSE, AS YOU GUYS KNOW,
WE HAVE SOME AMAZING PRIZES.

645
00:27:25,144 --> 00:27:28,714
THE FIRST IS A MODELING CONTRACT
WITH THE TOP INTERNATIONAL

646
00:27:28,714 --> 00:27:31,283
MODELING AGENCY--FORD MODELS--

647
00:27:31,283 --> 00:27:33,152
A PHOTO SPREAD
IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE,

648
00:27:33,152 --> 00:27:34,987
WHICH WILL BE SHOT
BY WORLD-RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER

649
00:27:34,987 --> 00:27:38,390
GILLES BENSIMON
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT

650
00:27:38,390 --> 00:27:40,192
WITH COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

651
00:27:40,192 --> 00:27:42,060
OF COURSE, WE HAVE OUR JUDGES
THAT WE HAVE SCHLEPPED

652
00:27:42,060 --> 00:27:43,996
ALL THE WAY FROM AMERICA.

653
00:27:43,996 --> 00:27:45,564
Janice: HONEY,
I DON'T SCHLEP.

654
00:27:45,564 --> 00:27:47,399
Tyra: FIRST
IS JANICE DICKINSON.

655
00:27:47,399 --> 00:27:50,569
JANICE IS THE WORLD'S
FIRST SUPERMODEL.

656
00:27:50,569 --> 00:27:53,305
NIGEL BARKER,
A NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER.

657
00:27:53,305 --> 00:27:56,642
NOLé MARIN, A PROMINENT
FASHION EDITOR AND STYLIST.

658
00:27:56,642 --> 00:27:58,977
AND OF COURSE, WE HAVE
A GUEST JUDGE THIS WEEK--

659
00:27:58,977 --> 00:28:01,980
MR. YOSHIE, WHO WAS
YOUR COMMERCIAL DIRECTOR.

660
00:28:01,980 --> 00:28:05,417
AND MR. YOSHIE DOES NOT SPEAK
ANY ENGLISH AT ALL,

661
00:28:05,417 --> 00:28:07,019
SO HE DON'T KNOW WHAT I'M SAYIN'
AT ALL RIGHT NOW.

662
00:28:07,019 --> 00:28:08,353
Janice: HI, YOSHIE.

663
00:28:08,353 --> 00:28:12,291
