00:28:24,670 --> 00:28:26,738
WE'RE LIKE, "IT'S GONNA BE
A FISH EYE"

670
00:28:26,738 --> 00:28:28,340
OR SOMETHING REALLY NASTY.

671
00:28:28,340 --> 00:28:30,576
