674
00:28:40,419 --> 00:28:41,987
Ann: I PUT IT IN MY MOUTH
AND SWALLOWED IT.

675
00:28:41,987 --> 00:28:44,389
THE UMEBOSHI
WAS ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTING.

676
00:28:44,389 --> 00:28:46,692
Nicole: SOMETIMES
EATING HEALTHY FOOD

677
00:28:46,692 --> 00:28:49,394
MEANS EATING YUCKY FOOD,
BUT NOT ANYMORE

678
00:28:49,394 --> 00:28:51,163
WITH ANTM UMEBOSHI.

679
00:28:53,465 --> 00:28:55,701
